  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unlocking the business potential of circular built environment sector in Hong Kong</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal is to showcase Dutch expertise through two symposia to foster collaboration to access market potential and identify promising partners for further discussions and recommendations. This will support Dutch circular built environment market and policy opportunities further enhancing the development of smart green buildings in Hong Kong. In continuation, the establishment of the Circo-hub Hong Kong will be kick-started in collaboration with the Business Environment Council.</narrative>
  </description>
